OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold and locally frosty start
OL,6,Fwith any early mist or fog patches in
OL,7,Fthe north slowly lifting. Dry with
OL,8,Fplenty of sunny spells throughout the
OL,9,Fday and light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining dry this evening
OL,12,Fand overnight with clear spells.
OL,13,FTemperatures falling away to leave a
OL,14,Fcold night and a widespread frost with
OL,15,Fa few mist and freezing fog patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
