OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA frosty start to Thursday
OL,6,Fwith lengthy spells of autumnal
OL,7,Fsunshine. Staying dry but feeling
OL,8,Fcolder, especially in the brisk
OL,9,Fnortherly wind. Another widespread
OL,10,Ffrost overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAnother
OL,13,Fcrisp autumnal day on Friday after a
OL,14,Ffrosty start. Somewhat cloudier over
OL,15,Fthe weekend with showery rain at times
OL,16,Fmixed with bright spells. Breezy with
OL,17,Ftemperatures recovering by Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
